6,Recent Trends in the Reconstruction of the Proto-Indo-European ... - JSTOR,https://www.jstor.org/stable/40848907,"to the reconstruction of the Proto-Indo-European phonological system. These two approaches were manifested in the German School on the one hand and in the French School on the other. The approach of the German School may be described as phonetically based, while that of the French School may be described as phonemi- cally based.","German, Standard",Indo-European
